--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -120,7 +120,7 @@ Model package sizes were checked against the official [Qwen3 8B](https://ollama.
 
 ## Connected code: ZIP now, GitHub refresh later
 
-Open **GitHub repositories**. Backend, Admin and Frontend each have a captured snapshot and **Upload replacement ZIP** control. No GitHub token is needed to use the uploaded code.
+Open **GitHub repositories**. Backend, Admin and Frontend each have a captured snapshot and **Upload replacement ZIP** control. No GitHub token is needed to use the uploaded code. A ZIP made from a working folder is fine: dependency, build and version-control folders (`node_modules`, `dist`, `build`, `.git`) and Finder metadata (`__MACOSX`, `.DS_Store`) are ignored before the size limits apply, and the coverage details list what was ignored. The ZIP itself must stay under 80 MB and hold at most 20,000 source files.
 
 The table below records the September 12 **imported baseline before local Studio fixes**. Studio shows the current working revisions and their later changes.
 
